  <name>COMPASS</name>
  <summary>Digital library for TTRPGs</summary>
  
  <description>
    <p>
      COMPASS is a desktop application that helps you organize all your Tabletop RPG resources.
      It provides powerful tools to catalog and manage your digital library of rulebooks, adventures,
      maps, and other gaming materials. Supports PDFs, images, and weblinks.
    </p>
    <p>Key Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Automatic metadata extraction from PDFs and webpages (title, author, release date, etc.)</li>
      <li>Advanced hierarchical tagging system to replace folder chaos</li>
      <li>Multiple collections, each with their own set of tags</li>
      <li>Four different layouts to view your collection</li>
      <li>Fuzzy search with advanced filtering and sorting</li>
      <li>Share your collection with others, including metadata, tags and files</li>
      <li>No vendor lock-in - all data saved in human-readable XML</li>
      <li>Cross-platform support with a modern UI</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  
